reat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_fat_bald_white_man.\" title=\"A fat bald white man.\">A fat bald white man.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Look_at_me.\" title=\"Look at me.\">Look at me.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hollowing_out_a_baguette.\" title=\"Hollowing out a baguette.\">Hollowing out a baguette.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Friendship_is_truth.\" title=\"Friendship is truth.\">Friendship is truth.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Meat.\" title=\"Meat.\">Meat.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spatchcock_it.\" title=\"Spatchcock it.\">Spatchcock it.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">No stars for naughty boys.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tony_Three_Pies.\" title=\"Tony Three Pies.\">Tony Three Pies.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">No stars for naughty boys.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/6e/No_stars_for_naughty_boys..png/revision/latest?cb=20210122090506\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"No stars for naughty boys.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/6e/No_stars_for_naughty_boys..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090506\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/6e/No_stars_for_naughty_boys..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090506 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/6e/No_stars_for_naughty_boys..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210122090506 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"No stars for naughty boys.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"No_stars_for_naughty_boys..png\" data-image-name=\"No stars for naughty boys..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">4</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Lycett\" title=\"Joe Lycett\">Joe Lycett</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spatchcock_it.\" title=\"Spatchcock it.\">Spatchcock it.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tony_Three_Pies.\" title=\"Tony Three Pies.\">Tony Three Pies.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>No stars for naughty boys.</b></i> is the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">Series 4</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 6 June 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Lycett\" title=\"Joe Lycett\">Joe Lycett</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/No_stars_for_naughty_boys.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"No stars for naughty boys\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> declined <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a>'s request for a star, after the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_wheelie_bin_across_the_finish_line\" title=\"Get this wheelie bin across the finish line\">Get this wheelie bin across the finish line</a> task. The title card shows a hand casting a shadow. A hand is used in reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Unveil_a_new_handshake\" title=\"Unveil a new handshake\">Unveil a new handshake</a> task\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/No_stars_for_naughty_boys.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Ingen stjerner til uartige drenge', which translates as 'No stars for naughty boys'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Ei tähtiä tuhmille pojille', which translates as 'No stars for naughty boys'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/No_stars_for_naughty_boys.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Dennis\" title=\"Hugh Dennis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Hugh Dennis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Lycett\" title=\"Joe Lycett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Lycett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lolly_Adefope\" title=\"Lolly Adefope\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lolly Adefope</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Giedroyc\" title=\"Mel Giedroyc\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mel Giedroyc</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Noel_Fielding\" title=\"Noel Fielding\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Noel Fielding</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_chair\" title=\"Best chair\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best chair.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bring_Alex_his_dinner\" title=\"Bring Alex his dinner\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Stand on one leg then continue reading. Your raised foot must not touch the ground until the task is complete. Bring Alex his dinner. Every time your raised foot touches the ground, you must eat a slice of Alex's dinner.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hide_from_Alex\" title=\"Hide from Alex\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Hide from Alex. Alex is in the caravan.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_wheelie_bin_across_the_finish_line\" title=\"Get this wheelie bin across the finish line\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Get this wheelie bin across the finish line. One of you must be in the bin at all times. The other person must be blindfolded at all times. The wheelie bin rider must direct the wheelie bin drivers to complete the course and the five challenges with. Also, no-one can speak English.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Unveil_a_new_handshake\" title=\"Unveil a new handshake\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Unveil a new handshake.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>